SUMMARY:Hardly Strictly Irish at Armstrong Redwoods Amphitheater!
DESCRIPTION:You simply cannot beat a great concert within a magnificent redwood forest! \nHARDLY STRICTLY IRISH (Suzuki Cady & Jimmy Murphy) play lovely\, lively traditional Irish tunes and sing soulful songs from a variety of genres on fiddle\, mandolin\, guitar\, and bodhrán. \n“A new\, local band is rocking the Bay Area—to high acclaim…They are commensurate acoustic musicians with decades of experience between them.” – Mark Fernquest\, Sebastopol Times \nNo cover (tips appreciated). There will be snacks and drinks for sale. \nHARDLY STRICTLY IRISH: suzukicady.com/hardly-strictly-irish\nVIDEOS: suzukicady.com/videos\nSHOWS: suzukicady.com/events\nPRESS: suzukicady.com/press
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/hardly-strictly-irish-at-armstrong-redwoods-amphitheater/
LOCATION:Armstrong Redwoods Forest Theater\, 17000 Armstrong Woods Road\, Guerneville\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
