SUMMARY:Dry Creek Station at Waterhawk
DESCRIPTION:Catch Dry Creek Station live at WaterHawk in Rohnert Park for a high-energy night of live music\, dancing\, great food\, and Sonoma County nightlife. Featuring powerful male and female lead vocals\, rich harmonies\, and a talented seven-piece lineup\, Dry Creek Station performs an upbeat mix of modern country favorites\, classic rock hits\, and danceable crowd-pleasers that keep audiences entertained all night long. \nKnown for its stylish atmosphere\, craft cocktails\, and popular dining experience\, WaterHawk is the perfect place to gather with friends for dinner\, drinks\, and live entertainment. Whether you’re hitting the dance floor or relaxing on the patio\, expect a lively evening with one of the North Bay’s favorite live bands.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/dry-creek-station-at-waterhawk/
LOCATION:Waterhawk\, 5000 Roberts Lake Road\, Rohnert Park\, 94928
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
