SUMMARY:Prune Packers Home Games
DESCRIPTION:Join the Healdsburg Prune Packers every summer from June to July (and the first week of August\, depending on the playoff schedule) for unforgettable competitive baseball in the heart of Sonoma County! \nWhether you’re planning a family outing\, gathering with friends\, or hosting a corporate event\, our games offer the perfect mix of excitement and community spirit.
