SUMMARY:Community Market Summer Music Series: LBZ & On The Same Page
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of live music with LBZ & On The Same Page as part of Community Market’s Summer Music Series. LBZ & On The Same Page bring a fun mix of rock\, soul\, funk\, pop\, and dance favorites. It’s the kind of show that makes it hard to stay in your seat. Bring a chair\, grab something to eat or drink\, and enjoy a summer evening of live music and community on the Mel Minton Memorial Stage. \nFree and all ages.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/community-market-summer-music-series-lbz-on-the-same-page/
