SUMMARY:Jazz Days on the Farm at Bees N Blooms
DESCRIPTION:Jazz Days on the Farm during Lavender Bloom Fest\, Sundays\, May 24\, June 21 & July 12\, 12pm to 3 pm. Admission $20 per person. Kids 12 and under are free with an adult.\nJoin us for an afternoon of classic blue-note jazz with the John Kalleen Jazz Group! The farm grounds are open from 10 AM to 4 PM\, and the band will play from noon to 3 PM. Tacos Don Pepe will be here on all jazz days\, serving up delicious organic and locally sourced Mexican food\, with vegan options and homemade tortillas! Reservations are required during Lavender Bloom Fest\, to ensure we have sufficient parking and that our guests have a wonderful experience.\nBeesNBlooms is a certified organic farm with a lavender labyrinth\, butterfly garden\, ducks\, geese and chickens\, a nursery with many lavender varieties\, pollinator plants & garden starts and a farm stand with Lavender products.\nBees N Blooms Lavender Labyrinth\, 3883 Petaluma Hill Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404\ninfo@beesnblooms.com\n707-293-8293 \nHome
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/jazz-days-on-the-farm-at-bees-n-blooms-2/
LOCATION:Bees N Blooms\, 3883 Petaluma Hill Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Holiday,Kids and Family,Music,Other,Recreation
END:VEVENT
