SUMMARY:Petaluma Art & Garden Festival
DESCRIPTION:Explore locally crafted sights\, sounds and tastes at Petaluma’s 23rd Art & Garden Festival\, a free celebration with 100+ handpicked art exhibitors offering high-quality\, handmade goods\, from garden and home décor to artisan jewelry and fine art. Enjoy live music\, beverages from local wineries\, breweries\, distilleries\, and tasty festival bites. The Children’s Corner features jump houses\, face painting\, and arts and crafts. Plus\, gardening experts will share tips. The festival spans Kentucky\, 4th\, and B Streets\, and the A St parking lot. Tasting packages are available for sampling local wine\, craft beer\, cider\, cocktails\, and more.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/petaluma-art-garden-festival/
LOCATION:Historic Downtown Petaluma\, 20 4th Street\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Art,Festival,Kids and Family,Music
END:VEVENT
